/*
  OLED Studio v3 - ESP8266 NodeMCU + SH1106 128x64 web controller

  Modes : Writing Board, Video Player, Text Display, Weather, Date & Time (3 styles),
          Timer (countdown / stopwatch), Event Countdown, Scrolling Text, Image, Device Info
  (Rec Playback was removed in v3.)

  Libraries : ESP8266 core (3.x recommended), U8g2
  IDE       : NodeMCU 1.0 (ESP-12E), CPU 160 MHz recommended, Flash 4MB.
  The web page is compiled into the firmware (web_ui.h) - no LittleFS upload needed.
  Brightness, flip, invert, auto-dim, clock style, 12/24 h and the saved event survive reboots (EEPROM).
*/

